{'symbol': 'CMI', 'date': '2022-09-08 03:00:00', 'title': 'CUMMINS SCALING BELGIUM ELECTROLYZER MANUFACTURING CAPACITY TO 1 GIGAWATT THROUGH IPCEI SUPPORT', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, IND.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CUMMINS INC. (NYSE: CMI) WILL EXPAND PEM ELECTROLYZER MANUFACTURING CAPACITY AT ITS OEVEL, BELGIUM, FACTORY TO 1 GIGAWATT (GW) WITH THE SUPPORT FROM THE IMPORTANT PROJECT OF COMMON EUROPEAN INTEREST (IPCEI) HY2TECH PROGRAM. IPCEI – RECENTLY APPROVED BY THE EUROPEAN COMMISSION, WITH FUNDING GRANTED BY FLANDERS INNOVATION & ENTREPRENEURSHIP AGENCY (VLAIO) – WILL HELP CUMMINS DEVELOP A NEW GENERATION OF PEM ELECTROLYZER CELL STACKS TO POWER LARGE-SCALE HYDROGEN'}